{%- comment -%}
  DRIP arrow. Used by .btn-link and anywhere the mockup shows a "->".

  Drawn rather than typed: the Zalando Sans subset ships no arrow glyph, so a
  text arrow would fall back to a system font. Inherits colour via
  currentColor and scales with font-size via the 1em sizing in
  assets/drip-buttons.css.

  aria-hidden because the arrow is decorative — the link text carries meaning.
{%- endcomment -%}
<svg
  class="btn-arrow"
  viewBox="0 0 16 16"
  aria-hidden="true"
  focusable="false"
  role="presentation"
>
  <path d="M1.5 8h13M9 2.5 14.5 8 9 13.5" stroke-linecap="square" />
</svg>
